# Coach blocked-door exit test on blocked_exit overlay:
# Player starts at (126,127) facing WEST beside Coach's open front-east cab door,
# enters Coach, drives dead straight SOUTH (zero steering) alongside the x=126
# building wall (y=128..135), stops completely, and presses Enter to test exit.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80

17000 shot start_bus
+50 tap enter 70
+2100 down up
+1200 up up
+50 down down
+300 up down
+1000 shot pinned_bus
+100 burst blocked_bus_exit 140 0
+30 tap enter 70
+2100 shot after_blocked_bus
+100 quit
